msgstr ""
"Tekanyo ya go laiša seswantšho ya %s ga e romele poledišano e swanetšego; "
"mohlomongwe e tšwa tokollong e fapanego ya GTK?"

#: gdk-pixbuf/gdk-pixbuf-io.c:833 gdk-pixbuf/gdk-pixbuf-io.c:884
#, c-format
